                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36f7cc6b-f181-34e6-a769-d11cbadbc040",
                        "entry_id": "cf1e5a89-4bdd-36e7-a4c4-af811762671e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het naar beneden gaan"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eda49125-4245-3eeb-93d3-f3c7c1f78043",
                        "entry_id": "cf1e5a89-4bdd-36e7-a4c4-af811762671e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het minder worden, het afgaan"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1b1b6ad-46e2-4607-8a78-9f21afcd22bb",
                                "sense_id": "eda49125-4245-3eeb-93d3-f3c7c1f78043",
                                "text": "Maar is de bron van het probleem niet dat miljoenen mensen wereldwijd ervan dromen om vroeg of laat Venetië te bezoeken? ‘Venetië is uniek in de wereld, het is een mirakel van menselijk vernuft, zoals de piramiden’, zegt Matteo Secchi. Hij laat zien hoe zijn haar op zijn armen overeind komt terwijl hij erover praat: ‘Venetië is een legende. Maar ik ween wanneer ik de neergang van mijn stad zie. We moeten een oplossing vinden. Iedereen is welkom hier, maar niet allemaal op hetzelfde moment.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50206d77-84c1-42ca-a041-69135ee3d399",
                                "sense_id": "eda49125-4245-3eeb-93d3-f3c7c1f78043",
                                "text": "De neergang in inkomsten was al jaren geleden te voorspellen, zegt Bert Scholtens, hoogleraar Duurzame economie aan de Rijksuniversiteit Groningen. \"Helaas zijn de aardgasbaten al die jaren nauwelijks gebruikt om zorg te dragen voor alternatieve energiebronnen, of om nieuwe verdiencapaciteit op te bouwen. Onze beleidsmakers zijn herhaaldelijk op dit probleem gewezen, maar hebben nooit gekozen voor een fundamentele koerswijziging.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05c91951-e752-4cec-b307-d8bede1f9cef",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf1e5a89-4bdd-36e7-a4c4-af811762671e",
                        "source_sense_id": "eda49125-4245-3eeb-93d3-f3c7c1f78043",
                        "source_sense_description": "(figuurlijk) het minder worden, het afgaan",
                        "target_lang_word": "decline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "decline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c53424e5-843b-3379-8124-caaaabe5ecb7",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916695-fb54-3bae-b11e-857410647e83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Downward movement, fall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4930b13d-029d-3752-a825-a9086696b52d",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916695-fb54-3bae-b11e-857410647e83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sloping downward, e.g. of a hill or road."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f5a53aa-7296-44ac-94ed-a89a55bd1f6c",
                                                "sense_id": "4930b13d-029d-3752-a825-a9086696b52d",
                                                "text": "After taking a right from that turn a decline will come into view."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca01e6f1-9d5e-34b2-ba20-d551d6d89671",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916695-fb54-3bae-b11e-857410647e83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A deterioration of condition; a weakening or worsening."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d52e879-3f27-4c06-a23a-b90eae0d7fd1",
                                                "sense_id": "ca01e6f1-9d5e-34b2-ba20-d551d6d89671",
                                                "text": "He has experienced a sudden decline in his health."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e0891f4-dcd5-41dd-b6d8-0d700bec4d5d",
                                                "sense_id": "ca01e6f1-9d5e-34b2-ba20-d551d6d89671",
                                                "text": "Educational standards are on the decline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f1981b6-11bb-4e8d-beb4-b8ca0a73c4f9",
                                                "sense_id": "ca01e6f1-9d5e-34b2-ba20-d551d6d89671",
                                                "text": "The country's global reputation is in decline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6e589bf-8451-4f10-aadd-87f96314d858",
                                                "sense_id": "ca01e6f1-9d5e-34b2-ba20-d551d6d89671",
                                                "text": "In an era when political leaders promise deliverance from decline through America’s purported preeminence in scientific research, the news that science is in deep trouble in the United States has been as unwelcome as a diagnosis of leukemia following the loss of health insurance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38067a0d-854c-394e-8221-caf6e4a7ed7d",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916695-fb54-3bae-b11e-857410647e83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A reduction or diminution of activity, prevalence or quantity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c17f7d8d-22eb-4402-9140-a6b3b64045de",
                                                "sense_id": "38067a0d-854c-394e-8221-caf6e4a7ed7d",
                                                "text": "Population decline is a major concern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fc10e89-bd62-4a42-88ab-a90eb6d83462",
                                                "sense_id": "38067a0d-854c-394e-8221-caf6e4a7ed7d",
                                                "text": "Town-centre retailers have seen a decline in footfall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4c7a284-4f10-46d8-81b5-e522160959fb",
                                                "sense_id": "38067a0d-854c-394e-8221-caf6e4a7ed7d",
                                                "text": "It is also pertinent to note that the current obvious decline in work on holarctic hepatics most surely reflects a current obsession with cataloging and with nomenclature of the organisms—as divorced from their study as living entities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a19f83b-cd47-426c-b301-03516011e852",
                                                "sense_id": "38067a0d-854c-394e-8221-caf6e4a7ed7d",
                                                "text": "\"It knows it has to plan for managed decline, but it can't even plan for managed decline if it doesn't know how much decline to manage.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5fbd67d-fa99-3ebb-b077-19741fbcf39d",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916695-fb54-3bae-b11e-857410647e83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of declining or refusing something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f24ad75a-0603-4217-bd3c-7b8d3854f4e6",
                                                "sense_id": "f5fbd67d-fa99-3ebb-b077-19741fbcf39d",
                                                "text": "The issuing bank only checks the consumer's credit card number for authorization. […] Soft declines are those declines in which the bank requires further verification."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "decline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f0c3d63-67b1-3bd2-8ae8-8fd9e034b05a",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move downwards, to fall, to drop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e9d12b5-21bf-439c-878a-161bd3fc9f15",
                                                "sense_id": "8f0c3d63-67b1-3bd2-8ae8-8fd9e034b05a",
                                                "text": "The dollar has declined rapidly since 2001."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65549dba-3336-31ed-ad43-1f1316f6d024",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become weaker or worse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62f060fa-6932-48aa-9368-4d93a544484f",
                                                "sense_id": "65549dba-3336-31ed-ad43-1f1316f6d024",
                                                "text": "My health declined in winter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23ff7d01-476b-445c-a81f-30fe10b60d05",
                                                "sense_id": "65549dba-3336-31ed-ad43-1f1316f6d024",
                                                "text": "After her sother died, Connie began to decline noticeably."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74a16b9b-6f67-30ae-b75a-409f10c09f53",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bend downward; to bring down; to depress; to cause to bend, or fall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3664b1c2-c0b1-4d64-aecd-6328589ddad4",
                                                "sense_id": "74a16b9b-6f67-30ae-b75a-409f10c09f53",
                                                "text": "in melancholy site, with head declined"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afddafae-1f4e-40b7-bcbf-a64f7e8d3f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "74a16b9b-6f67-30ae-b75a-409f10c09f53",
                                                "text": "And now faire Phoebus gan decline in hast / His weary wagon to the Westerne vale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b48db2a3-72d0-32c3-b0b1-6a1bc3234e7d",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to decrease or diminish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "044b63f3-714e-4b62-9312-e8df5f236b01",
                                                "sense_id": "b48db2a3-72d0-32c3-b0b1-6a1bc3234e7d",
                                                "text": "You have declin'd his means."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae2d125f-1231-4d62-95d1-aac08f9230e3",
                                                "sense_id": "b48db2a3-72d0-32c3-b0b1-6a1bc3234e7d",
                                                "text": "He knoweth his error, but will not seek to decline it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bd9953b-7149-3694-96a2-0c6321a3f51f",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To turn or bend aside; to deviate; to stray; to withdraw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adef1f16-9cdb-4f69-ad33-8706e2c6b787",
                                                "sense_id": "3bd9953b-7149-3694-96a2-0c6321a3f51f",
                                                "text": "a line that declines from straightness"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c779aae-d2f3-4633-8ac3-f3321f3e9e41",
                                                "sense_id": "3bd9953b-7149-3694-96a2-0c6321a3f51f",
                                                "text": "conduct that declines from sound morals"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "badc9b18-3c7f-490d-89a9-e1627a604176",
                                                "sense_id": "3bd9953b-7149-3694-96a2-0c6321a3f51f",
                                                "text": "Yet do I not decline from thy testimonies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5eca0726-ddba-37a6-8dc0-685ff72ecdcd",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To choose not to do something; refuse, forbear, refrain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93fca779-12c5-4cb3-bc6a-4383659490cb",
                                                "sense_id": "5eca0726-ddba-37a6-8dc0-685ff72ecdcd",
                                                "text": "Could I decline this dreadful hour?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd3b6fb9-5599-4f8a-9dc7-58c6d5343026",
                                                "sense_id": "5eca0726-ddba-37a6-8dc0-685ff72ecdcd",
                                                "text": "“[…] This is Mr. Churchill, who, as you are aware, is good enough to come to us for his diaconate, and, as we hope, for much longer; and being a gentleman of independent means, he declines to take any payment.” Saying this Walden rubbed his hands together and smiled contentedly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b392c6fd-932d-47ce-a7be-7e310c9e9c3d",
                                                "sense_id": "5eca0726-ddba-37a6-8dc0-685ff72ecdcd",
                                                "text": "On reflection I think I will decline your generous offer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0be5fde4-e3f7-318e-9068-1ae47ba57b50",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inflect for case, number, gender, and the like."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcf0a60e-8625-3add-9d95-4f9fead0b25f",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To recite all the different declined forms of (a word): to recite its declension."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a889da9-a6cb-48bc-863f-aa786ce6be42",
                                                "sense_id": "fcf0a60e-8625-3add-9d95-4f9fead0b25f",
                                                "text": "after the first declining of a noun and a verb"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba506c09-1f81-33e3-890d-de349520911b",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To run through from first to last; to recite in order as though declining a noun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a173e972-3829-44ba-ad19-78f638eca7a7",
                                                "sense_id": "ba506c09-1f81-33e3-890d-de349520911b",
                                                "text": "Decline all this, and see what now thou art. For happy wife, a most distressed widow;\nFor joyful mother, one that wails the name;\nFor one being sued to, one that humbly sues;\nFor queen , a very caitiff crown'd with care[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7762403c-2863-39ab-9ee5-6c700fe0a25e",
                                        "entry_id": "9c2b921c-9459-3e90-b902-277207d7f2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reject a penalty against the opposing team, usually because the result of accepting it would benefit the non-penalized team less than the preceding play."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canadian"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6465adf2-5465-4b8b-b956-93fbf80c8e15",
                                                "sense_id": "7762403c-2863-39ab-9ee5-6c700fe0a25e",
                                                "text": "The team chose to decline the fifteen-yard penalty because their receiver had caught the ball for a thirty-yard gain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
